Expert evaluator, atomic checklist. Given: IMAGE, ATOMS, REFERENCE, MACHINE DESC.
IMAGE = primary truth. Tolerance: +/-3pp numerical, colour synonyms.
Steps: (1) Accuracy (image+atoms) (2) Completeness (atoms) (3) Hallucination
(4) Clarity. Severity: atom sev caps error sev. Crit/Imp+miss->Major, partial->Minor.
